                                                "sense_id": "60a6a7fb-a789-31d3-bda5-9c2bfba695c3",
                                                "text": "Joseph Sedley, who was fond of music, and soft-hearted, was in a state of ravishment during the performance of the song, and profoundly touched at its conclusion."
                                            }
